{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":241021,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793380460269,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2024,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5UyWYVRySk1Hhmwvb5KHMQYIG4S.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"4979244","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hot spring hunter Yukawa Yoshizou finds himself transported to another world with Inari's messenger princess, Mayudama-san. Smelling the smell of sulfurous springs, he ignores the mysterious world and rushes towards the smell.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nPKmPy4PhKF9rH0RXyoMKLeQO3d.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPKmPy4PhKF9rH0RXyoMKLeQO3d.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"5070025","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Kozo and Mayudama are bathing together, an elf girl appears in front of them. For some reason, she is openly hostile and attacks the naked Kozo and Mayudama with magic.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1TzUiMJ6upsQupBGejKfQwh9ExH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TzUiMJ6upsQupBGejKfQwh9ExH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"5070026","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lilium, an elf girl, is defeated by Mayudama. She is stripped naked and thrown into a newly discovered moor spring in the forest. It seems that elves fear hot springs as cursed springs of death...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j7Z5AQckPdqFDIEUaEl3y8nST1K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7Z5AQckPdqFDIEUaEl3y8nST1K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"5070027","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Thanks to Yoshizo and Mayudama, Lilium discovers the wonders of hot springs. Yoshizo explains that hot springs are a gift from nature that should be shared with everyone. Then, Lilium's sister, Ohendek, the chief of the elves, appears.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j4xBjz4FDHYD7ISdLsZiA2KhPHY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j4xBjz4FDHYD7ISdLsZiA2KhPHY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"5070028","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ohendek also joins Yoshizo and the others in the mixed bath. Just when he thinks he's enjoying the wonders of the hot springs, he is astonished to see Mayudama's fox ears and tail, and hurriedly bows his head.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hxlzFMol0RmDvDHvS9Xh3fP38cE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hxlzFMol0RmDvDHvS9Xh3fP38cE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"5070029","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Mayudama and Lilium become good friends, Ohendek is intrigued by the effects of the hot springs that Yoshizo talks about. The elf village is currently facing financial difficulties, and they want to use the hot springs to overcome this.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":5.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1zo1DaXsLNx1HChoT1be7K6FdVE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1zo1DaXsLNx1HChoT1be7K6FdVE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"5070030","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yoshizo comes up with a plan to build a hot springs town in the elf village. Mayudama, Lillium, and Ohendek start daydreaming about what a sexy hot springs town would look like...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/odxzMTMMUvPJJXLwOyPmXTqGSbb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/odxzMTMMUvPJJXLwOyPmXTqGSbb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241021/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"5070031","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to bring back vitality to his hometown, Yoshizo was searching for a hot spring that could become a tourist attraction. After falling off a cliff, he was reincarnated into another world by the Inari deity of a small, forgotten shrine.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-03-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2KKvbZ7YwwESI9vtYT1GtN7yhbF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2KKvbZ7YwwESI9vtYT1GtN7yhbF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourc